{"id":"n35136-2-7","stage":1,"title":"궁금하다 · 好奇","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n35136-2-7-1","ko":"민준아, 나는 네가 밥은 먹었나, 학교는 잘 갔나, 늘 궁금하다.","zh":"敏俊啊，我总挂念着你有没有吃饭，有没有顺利去上学。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"민준아,","meaning":"敏俊","explanation":"민준：敏俊；아：呼格助词，用来称呼关系亲近的人或晚辈。","readings":[{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"민준아","audio":"/audio/8016ce64193f3153a82a.mp3"}},{"text":"나는","meaning":"我","explanation":"나：我；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"나","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60931","senseId":"1","lemma":"나","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나는","audio":"/audio/39967d81683e1aa6d7f3.mp3"}},{"text":"네가","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"네가","audio":"/audio/3bd2d2d84b2dc14c59a4.mp3"}},{"text":"밥은","meaning":"饭，餐","explanation":"밥：饭，餐；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"밥","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62683","senseId":"2","lemma":"밥","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"밥은","audio":"/audio/9bd554d2a3fa2bf7a1e1.mp3"}},{"text":"먹었나,","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"먹었나","audio":"/audio/fcf09ea11b9b38be7700.mp3"}},{"text":"학교는","meaning":"学校","explanation":"학교：学校；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"학교","audio":"/audio/f7b9c878ccca829ab6ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73276","senseId":"1","lemma":"학교","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"학교는","audio":"/audio/033d4b5794ff2b0d36c9.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"갔나,","meaning":"去，上","explanation":"가다：去，上；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；나：表示疑问或推测内容，常与 보다、싶다 等合用。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"6","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"갔나","audio":"/audio/68a087f956ebf95fc30f.mp3"}},{"text":"늘","meaning":"总，老，老是，经常","explanation":"늘：总，老，老是，经常","readings":[{"term":"늘","audio":"/audio/96a6023ce9edabaa6631.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"40481","senseId":"1","lemma":"늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"늘","audio":"/audio/96a6023ce9edabaa6631.mp3"}},{"text":"궁금하다.","meaning":"好奇，挂念","explanation":"궁금하다：好奇，挂念；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"궁금하다","audio":"/audio/8aa230c6a19b7e60293f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"35136","senseId":"2","lemma":"궁금하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"궁금하다","audio":"/audio/8aa230c6a19b7e60293f.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"1098bbe54520ab2a","term":"나","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/1098bbe54520ab2a367c.mp3","entryId":"60931","definition":"说话人在朋友或晚辈面前用来指称自己。","pronunciation":["나"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"828fa1e7e354b408","term":"밥","zh":"饭，餐","audio":"/audio/828fa1e7e354b408527f.mp3","entryId":"62683","definition":"每天在一定时间吃的食物。","pronunciation":["밥"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"f7b9c878ccca829a","term":"학교","zh":"学校","au