}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저는","audio":"/audio/0b05af6c0b14d6e70820.mp3"}},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}},{"text":"지내고","meaning":"度日，生活","explanation":"지내다：度日，生活；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"1","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지내고","audio":"/audio/105243a4d294469934cc.mp3"}},{"text":"있어요.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있어요","audio":"/audio/499f8423f214354759ff.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"7582493f75565a84","term":"걱정","zh":"担心，忧虑，担忧","audio":"/audio/7582493f75565a84cbf1.mp3","entryId":"17232","definition":"害怕发生不好的事情而感到不安。","pronunciation":["걱쩡"]},{"id":"f8b54c8d9bfb2043","term":"말다","zh":"不再做，停止","audio":"/audio/f8b54c8d9bfb2043a3b8.mp3","entryId":"72580","definition":"表示使无法做之前的话所指的行动。","pronunciation":["말ː다"]},{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"母亲，妈妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于指称或称呼生育自己的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度日，生活","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"以某种程度或状态过日子。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/e8f4c5b99042d0d6d362.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.78,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=35136","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"2","sourceLevel":"초급","day":49,"sequenceScore":2.2044,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["敏俊，我不在意你有没有吃饭上学。","敏俊啊，我总挂念着你有没有吃饭，有没有顺利去上学。","敏俊，我总想知道你昨天看了什么电影。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["妈妈，您应该更担心我才对。","妈妈，我最近一直过得不好。","别担心，妈妈。我过得很好哦。"],"answer":2}]}
